        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">3. Tax reform regulatory liability: Docket No. RM18-12-000</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">4. Mainline Transmission Retainage Tracker should list the following Docket Nos.: RP19-968-000, RP20-927-000, RP22-1071-000, RP22-1168-000, RP23-770-000, RP24-590-000, RP24-858-000, RP24-883-000, RP25-1143-000, RP25-1175-000, RP25-749-000, RP25-924-000, RP25-929-000, RP25-1113-000, RP26-15-000, RP26-129-000</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Salesforce Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">,</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%">RP26-299-000, RP26-417-000</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">5. Gathering imbalance regulatory liability: Equitrans' FERC Gas Tariff Section 6.33</span>
      </div>
